# Cross-agent read-only context mounts, applied by mount-all-context.sh
# (manually via sudo, or at boot through context-mounts.service).
# Each line: <source-repo-path>  <agent-root>
# The source is bind-mounted read-only at <agent-root>/context-repos/<basename>.
#
# Copy to context-mounts.conf and list your fleet's cross-references.
#
/home/USER/projects/alpha/repo-alpha    /home/USER/projects/beta
/home/USER/projects/beta/repo-beta      /home/USER/projects/alpha
